# Relaunch after building

After every successful build of Membrae, quit the running app and launch the new build right away:

```sh
osascript -e 'quit app id "com.ethanfox.PersonalContext"'; sleep 2; open build/Build/Products/Debug/Membrae.app
```

Do not ask the user to relaunch it.
